              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LovingSpud5595"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Nice and simple, I fry 150g of chopped onions before frying the garlic and add a 1/2 teaspoon of cumin power 30 seconds before adding the tomatoes, yummy",
            "datePublished": "2024-01-03T17:55:44.090Z"
