            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gina Colleen Milligan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I realized too late that I was out of jarred pasta sauce. I searched online for something quick and easy, and this recipe more than met that criteria! I didn't expect it to be as delicious as it is! I added fresh bell peppers &amp; vine ripened tomatoes, then simmered it until the peppers were cooked cooked through. The entire family, including a child who \"despises\" tomatoes &amp; any type of peppers, adored it &amp; all requested that I make it again soon! This will be my go-to recipe from now on! I will NEVER use jarred pasta sauce again!",
            "datePublished": "2017-10-10T05:25:22.637Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
