              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "j.b."
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added 1 T. sugar (just because!) and used my immersion blender to puree after simmering in the pot - LOVED IT! We like sauce without tomato paste, and this had plenty of flavor and texture without it.",
            "datePublished": "2011-02-06T07:24:11.400Z"
