            },
            "reviewBody": "I used what I had on hand and WOW, so good. I used 1 can petite diced tomatoes (w/olive oil &amp; garlic) and one can plain. Also used fresh basil from a tube that I keep in the freezer. We used this sauce over manicotti, with garlic bread, and a salad, a glass of Pinot Grigio...great dish...thanks!",
